      "writtenOn": "2022-11-07T15:40:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, I realized that simultaneous (not serialized) deletion and creation of VMs having the same name can cause a race condition here.\n\nSpecifically, when a vm is created, the dir and files are created first and then sInstancesMap is updated. So, if the creation happens just between #730 and #732, then #734 will delete the entry added by the creator.\n\nI wonder if such a race condition is worth preventing, but anything can happen in apps...",
